feat(ra): infantry specials, crates, vortex

This commit implements RA specials I (non-shroud-dependent):

1. Engineer building capture (IsCaptureable gate per BDATA)
2. Attack dogs (kill infantry in one bite)
3. Medics (heal infantry)
4. Tanya demolition (C4 on structures)
5. MAD tank (seismic charge + self-destruct sequence)
6. Spy/Thief wired into Game command flow
8. Crates (money/unit/invulnerability)
9. Chronal vortex (ramp through base destroying in sequence)

All specials are deterministic across identical games. The `ra_specials_each_deterministic` test validates each special individually and ensures overall determinism.

